[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8342.95, "timestamp": "02:19:02", "text": "只瞄准头部射击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8345.349, "timestamp": "02:19:05", "text": "。 顺便一提，有一种推车可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8346.95, "timestamp": "02:19:06", "text": "让你自动只击中头部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8348.79, "timestamp": "02:19:08", "text": "。 所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8350.95, "timestamp": "02:19:10", "text": "请注意这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8368.23, "timestamp": "02:19:28", "text": "我稍后会拿到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8369.589, "timestamp": "02:19:29", "text": "僵尸会从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8372.87, "timestamp": "02:19:32", "text": "你站着的这扇门里出来。 对，就是这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8385.83, "timestamp": "02:19:45", "text": "呃，你是只想要红色的车，还是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8387.509, "timestamp": "02:19:47", "text": "蓝色的车也行？ 顺便说一句，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8388.389, "timestamp": "02:19:48", "text": "如果你玩得低，可能会死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8392.309, "timestamp": "02:19:52", "text": "嗯，是的，我做了蓝色之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8395.67, "timestamp": "02:19:55", "text": "不，不要选蓝色。 选红色就行了。"}]